{UTF-8}
{ Chapter 28: a cohort of 10,000 contract customers. One aggregate stock with the average churn rate against five segments whose churn rates differ (the conditional means of the quintiles of a gamma distribution with shape 2 and mean 0.05 per month). }
Segment:
	S1, S2, S3, S4, S5
	~	~	Five equal segments of the cohort, from the most loyal (S1) to the least (S5).
	|
Average Churn Rate=
	0.05
	~	1/month
	~	Average fraction of customers who leave per month, as a single number.
	|
Cohort Size=
	10000
	~	customer
	~	Customers signed at month 0.
	|
Aggregate Customers= INTEG(
	-Aggregate Churn,
	Cohort Size)
	~	customer
	~	The cohort as one stock.
	|
Aggregate Churn=
	Aggregate Customers * Average Churn Rate
	~	customer/month
	~	|
Segment Churn Rate[Segment]=
	0.01275, 0.02746, 0.04213, 0.06154, 0.10612
	~	1/month
	~	Churn rate of each segment; their average is 0.05.
	|
Segment Customers[Segment]= INTEG(
	-Segment Churn[Segment],
	Cohort Size / 5)
	~	customer
	~	The cohort split into five segments.
	|
Segment Churn[Segment]=
	Segment Customers[Segment] * Segment Churn Rate[Segment]
	~	customer/month
	~	|
Customers=
	SUM(Segment Customers[Segment!])
	~	customer
	~	Customers still active, all segments.
	|
Total Churn=
	SUM(Segment Churn[Segment!])
	~	customer/month
	~	|
Observed Churn Rate=
	ZIDZ(Total Churn, Customers)
	~	1/month
	~	The churn rate a manager would measure: total churn over active customers.
	|
Margin per Customer=
	1
	~	dollar/customer/month
	~	Monthly margin per active customer.
	|
Discount Rate=
	0.01
	~	1/month
	~	|
Discount Factor=
	EXP(-Discount Rate * Time)
	~	dmnl
	~	|
Aggregate Value= INTEG(
	Aggregate Customers * Margin per Customer * Discount Factor,
	0)
	~	dollar
	~	Present value of the cohort's margin, aggregate model.
	|
Segment Value= INTEG(
	Customers * Margin per Customer * Discount Factor,
	0)
	~	dollar
	~	Present value of the cohort's margin, segmented model.
	|
********************************************************
	.Control
********************************************************~
		Simulation Control Parameters
	|
FINAL TIME  = 60
	~	month
	~	|
INITIAL TIME  = 0
	~	month
	~	|
SAVEPER  = TIME STEP
	~	month
	~	|
TIME STEP  = 0.0625
	~	month
	~	|
